    "goal": "Co-seed HUVEC-T1 and primary human hepatocytes (PHH) in a 12-well plate at 2.66e5 cells/cm² total across 6.78 cm² per well, with 23.5% of the total assigned to HUVEC-T1.",
    "rationale": "Co-culture seeding of an endothelial (HUVEC-T1) and hepatocyte (PHH) liver-lobule model. Total density 2.66e5 cells/cm² over 6.78 cm²/well gives ~1.8e6 cells/well. Fraction A (HUVEC-T1) = 0.235, so per-well A = 0.235 × 2.66e5 × 6.78 ≈ 4.24e5 and B = 1.38e6, giving an A:B ratio of ~0.307:1 (~1:3.26). PHH are primary human hepatocytes (BSL-2) that do not divide in vitro, so seeding density is the working density. Assumes a single well as the base unit; totals scale linearly with well count.",
